{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "Vectors of the hybrid logical clock of the sync protocol (web ADR 0077, mobile ADR 0003 and protocol sections 1 and 2.2). A clock is (milliseconds since 1970-01-01 UTC << 16) | counter, written as 16 lower-case hexadecimal digits; a device id is 16 bytes, written in base64url without padding. A stamp is a clock and a device id, ordered by the clock, then by the bytes of the device id. Expected values come from the stepwise rules of Kulkarni et al. (Logical Physical Clocks).",
